---
title: "Which clock drives each footer count?"
accTitle: "Two clocks for Keep drain and vault inbox counts"
accDescr: "Vault inbox counts update from gkeep_inbox.md events. Keep drain counts update only on focus with a 15 minute TTL, after a pull, or on click."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 16
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 240
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph VAULT["Vault inbox"]
    direction TB
    FILE["`**gkeep_inbox.md**<br/>vault file`"]
    COUNT["`**Open-task count**<br/>in the plugin`"]
    FILE -->|"modify, create,<br/>delete, rename"| COUNT
  end
  subgraph KEEP["Keep drain"]
    direction TB
    TRIG["`**Focus, TTL,<br/>pull, or click**`"]
    STATUS["`**bob gkeep status**<br/>no pinentry`"]
    CACHE["`**Host cache**<br/>status.json`"]
    TRIG ==> STATUS
    STATUS -->|"snapshot when stale"| CACHE
    CACHE -->|"paint Keep half"| CHIP["`**Keep chip**`"]
  end
  COUNT -->|"paint inbox half"| CHIP2["`**Inbox chip**`"]
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef decision fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#C77C02,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A3000
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  class FILE,COUNT,CHIP2 focus
  class TRIG,STATUS decision
  class CACHE,CHIP outcome
  style VAULT fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style KEEP fill:none,stroke:#C77C02
